## [S6] 거부가 던지는 것 — 예외 타입과 @HandleAuthorizationDenied 대체값

denied() 예외 클래스    = org.springframework.security.authorization.AuthorizationDeniedException
  AccessDeniedException 으로 잡히나 = true
  AuthorizationDeniedException 인가 = true
  getAuthorizationResult() = ExpressionAuthorizationDecision [granted=false, expressionAttribute=hasRole('NOPE')]
deniedWithFallback()   -> 가려진 값(핸들러가 돌려줌)
